msgid "QM/MM interfaces"
msgstr "QM/MM 界面"

msgid ""
"Although Molpro itself does not offer any interface to force field programs,"
" the coupling is supplied by other commercial and non-commercial software. "
"The following is a list of QM/MM software which allow the use of Molpro ."
msgstr ""
"尽管 Molpro 本身不提供任何与力场程序的接口，但耦合由其他商业和非商业软件提供。以下是允许使用 Molpro 的 QM/MM 软件列表。"

msgid "Chemshell"
msgstr "Chemshell"

msgid ""
"The Chemshell computational chemistry environment (https://chemshell.org) "
"offers an interface to many well known force field software (CHARMM, GROMOS,"
" GULP,...). The program supports several geometry optimization algorithms; a"
" molecular dynamics driver for :math:`NVE`, :math:`NVT` and :math:`NPT` "
"ensembles; Monte Carlo; and many other utilities."
msgstr ""
"Chemshell "
"计算化学环境（https://chemshell.org）提供了与许多知名力场软件（CHARMM、GROMOS、GULP…）的接口。该程序支持多种几何优化算法；用于"
" :math:`NVE`\\ 、\\ :math:`NVT` 和 :math:`NPT` 系综的分子动力学驱动程序；蒙特卡洛；以及许多其他实用程序。"

msgid "The Chemshell Manual can be found at the following website:"
msgstr "Chemshell 手册可在以下网站找到："

msgid "https://chemshell.org/documentation/"
msgstr "https://chemshell.org/documentation/"

msgid ""
"Instructions on the use of Molpro are available therein. Also concerning the"
" Chemshell environment, a free Graphical User Interface (GUI) has been "
"released. The CCP1GUI facilitates the input for hybrid calculations, allows "
"visualisation of molecular structures and includes molecule editing tools."
msgstr ""
"其中提供了关于使用 Molpro 的说明。同样关于 Chemshell 环境，已发布了一个免费的图形用户界面（GUI）。CCP1GUI "
"简化了混合计算的输入，允许可视化分子结构，并包含分子编辑工具。"

msgid ""
"The Molpro program package can be used in combination with other software to"
" perform hybrid Quantum Mechanics/Molecular Mechanics (QM/MM) calculations. "
"Through the use of point charges, electrostatic embedding can be used for "
"both energy and gradient runs. In particular, lattices of point charges can "
"be included in an external file, gradients with respect to charge positions "
"can be computed, as described in section `lattice of point charges "
"<molecular_geometry.html#lattice-of-point-charges>`__. Gradients with "
"respect to QM nuclear positions can be computed (and include the effect of "
"the MM charges) as usual using the FORCE command (section :doc:`energy "
"gradients <energy_gradients>`)."
msgstr ""
"Molpro "
"程序包可与其他软件结合使用，以执行混合量子力学/分子力学（QM/MM）计算。通过使用点电荷，静电嵌入可用于能量和梯度计算。特别地，点电荷晶格可包含在外部文件中，并且可以计算关于电荷位置的梯度，如章节"
" `点电荷晶格 <molecular_geometry.html#lattice-of-point-charges>`__ 中所述。关于 QM "
"核位置的梯度可以如常使用 FORCE 命令（章节 :doc:`能量梯度 <energy_gradients>`\\ ）计算（并包含 MM 电荷的影响）。"
